{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Cr5PxNvBrJvnGxUNgCHJn1","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Brownfield Discovery â€” Execution Log\n2\t\n3\t> Foreman appends per-wave EXECUTE/GATE/REVIEW/JUDGE/FIX verdicts here during the build.\n4\t\n5\t## Wave 1 â€” brownfield_scan.py â€” PASS\n6\t- Implemented `brownfield_scan.py`: bounded walk (depth<=6, files<=5000), skips\n7\t  `.git/node_modules/_archive/.anchor`, classifies by trio provenance signals\n8\t  (foreman checkpoint/config -> build; named planning docs -> planning;\n9\t  report.md/pdf under research/ -> research; deliverables/** -> deliverables;\n10\t  generic *.pdf + root *PLAN*.md -> docs, NOT adopted). Robust to\n11\t  missing/mistyped/UNC path (empty ScanResult, no raise).\n12\t- `tests/test_brownfield_scan.py` (18 tests) green: full ScanResult + exact\n13\t  numeric counts for the planted fixture, parametrized single-file\n14\t  classification, robustness cases, own-`.anchor`-store-not-imported,\n15\t  JSON-serializable `to_dict`.\n16\t\n17\t## Wave 2 â€” effort_history discovery model + reconciliation â€” PASS\n18\t- Added `source=\"discovered\"`, stable path-hash `discovered_job_id`,\n19\t  `adopt_discovered` (idempotent upsert + prune-on-rescan), `reconcile_discovered`\n20\t  (prune-on-deleted-artifact). Discovered records carry real metadata only\n21\t  (rel path, mtime->created_at, title, kind), NO cost/tokens/session_id.\n22\t- `lane_rollup`/`project_rollup` EXCLUDE discovered from effort_count + cost,\n23\t  add parallel `discovered_count` (+ `discovered_cost`=0). `list_efforts` still\n24\t  returns discovered records.\n25\t- `tests/test_brownfield_adopt.py` (6 tests) green: 2 real + 3 discovered ->\n26\t  effort_count==2/discovered_count==3/cost unchanged; idempotent double-adopt;\n27\t  rescan prunes deleted artifact; reconcile never prunes real efforts.\n28\t- LOCKED `tests/test_cost_rollup.py` 3/2/1 effort_count asserts STILL green\n29\t  (seeds no discovered efforts).\n30\t\n31\t## Wave 3 â€” render honesty â€” PASS\n32\t- `_gather_project_efforts` threads `discovered`/`artifact_path`/`title`/`kind`;\n33\t  vN computed over REAL efforts only; discovered cards get an `imported` marker\n34\t  + a small `.dotdisc` dot + `data-discovered=\"1\"`, NO vN, cost 0, never\n35\t  live/done, and link to `/artifact/<pid>?path=<rel>` (not `/report`).\n36\t- Tile + cost rollup render `N efforts Â· M imported Â· $X`.\n37\t- `tests/test_brownfield_render.py` (3 tests) green.\n38\t- LOCKED `tests/test_rnd_project_window_kanban.py` `>v2<`/`>v1<` STILL green\n39\t  WITH a discovered card also present in the served HTML.\n40\t\n41\t## Wave 4 â€” /artifact route + status_line + home panel â€” PASS\n42\t- New `GET /artifact/<pid>?path=<rel>` using `report_viewer.resolve_project_artifact`\n43\t  (the katex_asset containment pattern: target=(folder/rel).resolve();\n44\t  target.relative_to(folder) or reject). Rejects absolute rel, ../.. escape,\n45\t  .git/.anchor, symlink-escape -> 400/404, ZERO bytes read.\n46\t- `rnd_registry.status_line()` now reflects adopted+real per lane\n47\t  (has-runs / imported / none-yet) â€” no longer hardcoded.\n48\t- Home dashboard R&D panel/tiles populate (tile reads project_rollup +\n49\t  status_line; shows `N efforts Â· M imported`).\n50\t- Added `discover_and_adopt(pid)` pipeline + `POST /api/rnd/rescan` + Rescan\n51\t  buttons on the project window, tile, and home panel.\n52\t- `tests/test_artifact_route_safety.py` (14 pass, 1 skip â€” symlink needs admin\n53\t  on this host; containment via resolve() covers it). LOCKED\n54\t  `tests/test_report_route_safety.py` (single-segment `_unsafe_path_seg`) STILL\n55\t  green â€” the new route uses a SEPARATE containment guard, not `_unsafe_path_seg`.\n56\t\n57\t## Wave 5 â€” Anchor.md marker writer (lock-safe, no-churn) â€” PASS\n58\t- `anchor_marker.write_anchor_md(folder)`: renders `Anchor.md` at folder root,\n59\t  STRUCTURE ONLY (project sections, per-lane real+imported counts, relative\n60\t  paths, titles, last-scanned), under `paths.WRITE_LOCK`, hash-compared\n61\t  (no-churn â€” unchanged folder is NOT rewritten on 2nd open). Machine sidecar\n62\t  `.anchor/projects/<id>/discovery.json` = full ScanResult.\n63\t- `tests/test_anchor_marker.py` (7 tests) green: no secret/file-content leak,\n64\t  no-churn, structural-change rewrite, sidecar, N-projects sections, 24-thread\n65\t  concurrency yields one consistent file, missing-folder noop.\n66\t\n67\t## Wave 6 â€” wiring (register + open + Rescan) â€” PASS\n68\t- `discover_and_adopt(pid)` wired into register (`select_existing_project` /\n69\t  `create_new_folder_project`), open (`GET /project/<id>`), and\n70\t  `POST /api/rnd/rescan`. Rescan buttons added to project window + tile + home\n71\t  panel. Idempotent (stable path-hash job_ids -> no dupes), prunes deletions.\n72\t- `tests/test_brownfield_wiring.py` (3 tests, live throwaway server) green:\n73\t  register populates tile (imported) + Kanban (3 discovered cards) + writes\n74\t  Anchor.md; open re-syncs; rescan idempotent + prunes a deleted artifact;\n75\t  unknown-project rescan -> clean 404.\n76\t\n77\t## Wave 7 â€” end-to-end live verify + full-suite gate â€” PASS\n78\t- `python -m pytest -q`: **284 passed, 1 skipped** (symlink-escape test skips â€”\n79\t  symlink creation needs admin on this host; `resolve_project_artifact`\n80\t  containment via `resolve()`+`relative_to()` covers that path and the direct\n81\t  rejection test exercises it). Baseline 236 unchanged + 48 new; NO existing\n82\t  test weakened/deleted.\n83\t- LIVE HTTP smoke (throwaway server port=0, never 8777, no live claude) ALL\n84\t  PASS on a tmp folder seeded with planning/MASTER-PLAN.md +\n85\t  foreman-checkpoint.json + an incidental vendored paper.pdf:\n86\t  * home R&D panel shows `2 imported` + the tile; project window shows 2\n87\t    discovered cards (data-discovered, no vN, /artifact links, imported marker);\n88\t  * the incidental 